 "lines": [
  {
   "speaker": "BRENDAN",
   "text": "Just me and Blaine.",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "WIEGERT",
   "text": "OK. And what do you do after mom leaves?",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "BRENDAN",
   "text": "Watch TV until Blaine goes up ta the road ta get picked up from his friend.",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "WIEGERT",
   "text": "Is Bobbie home yet?",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "BRENDAN",
   "text": "mm uh. (shakes head \"no\")",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "WIEGERT",
   "text": "OK, so Blaine leaves the house to get picked up to go with a friend, and what do you do?",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "BRENDAN",
   "text": "I was watching TV until say six o'er, 5:30 until I called Travis and then after that I got a phone call at 6:00.",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "WIEGERT",
   "text": "Who called you at 6:00?",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "BRENDAN",
   "text": "Blaine's boss.",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "WIEGERT",
   "text": "OK.",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "FASSBENDER",
   "text": "What's his name?",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "BRENDAN",
   "text": "Mike.",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "FASSBENDER",
   "text": "OK.",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "WIEGERT",
   "text": "Mike what?",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "BRENDAN",
   "text": "Cornelly (ph)",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "WIEGERT",
   "text": "OK. So 6:00 o'clock Mike calls?",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "BRENDAN",
   "text": "mm huh.",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "WIEGERT",
   "text": "And then what?",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "BRENDAN",
   "text": "Then I still watched TV after that and, then get a phone call at 7:00 from Steven.",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
